WEBVTT

NOTE F1: single participant, short linear task. Synthetic.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Interviewer>Could you talk me through how you book a meeting room?</v>

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Priya Shah>Sure. I need a room whenever I've got a client call. I want somewhere quiet so the client gets a decent experience.</v>

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Priya Shah>First I open the room booking site on the intranet. It's bookmarked.</v>

4
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Priya Shah>Then I pick the day and the time slot I need, usually an hour.</v>

5
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:58.000
<v Priya Shah>It shows which rooms are free, and I pick one of the small ones near my desk.</v>

6
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:09.000
<v Priya Shah>I hit confirm, and it sends me an email.</v>

7
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:20.000
<v Priya Shah>Then I accept the invite in the email so it lands in my Outlook calendar. And that's me done.</v>

8
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:27.000
<v Interviewer>How long does that usually take?</v>

9
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:36.000
<v Priya Shah>Oh, two minutes, maybe less. It's honestly fine.</v>

10
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.000
<v Interviewer>And how often do you do it?</v>

11
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:52.000
<v Priya Shah>A couple of times a week.</v>
